{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"php","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"PHP","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for PHP (.php .phtml .php5 .inc).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"php","name":"PHP","extensions":[".php",".phtml",".php5",".inc"],"grammar":"grammars/php.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"PHP","path":"snippets/php.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/php.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"<\\\\?(?:php|=)?|\\\\?>\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#\\\\[[^\\\\]]*\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:include_once|require_once|enddeclare|endforeach|implements|instanceof|endswitch|insteadof|interface|namespace|protected|abstract|callable|continue|endwhile|function|readonly|declare|default|extends|finally|foreach|include|private|require|elseif|endfor|global|public|return|static|switch|array|break|catch|class|clone|const|empty|endif|final|isset|match|print|throw|trait|unset|while|yield|case|echo|else|enum|eval|exit|goto|list|and|die|for|new|try|use|var|xor|as|do|fn|if|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:__NAMESPACE__|__FUNCTION__|PHP_INT_MAX|__METHOD__|__CLASS__|__FILE__|__LINE__|__DIR__|PHP_EOL|false|FALSE|true|null|TRUE|NULL)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:iterable|callable|string|object|parent|static|float|array|mixed|never|bool|void|self|null|int)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:array_key_exists|str_starts_with|array_filter|array_values|str_contains|array_merge|str_replace|json_encode|json_decode|array_keys|preg_match|array_map|in_array|var_dump|explode|implode|print_r|sprintf|strlen|substr|count|isset|unset)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/php.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"PHP tag\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"php\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<?php\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Open and close tags\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"function ${1:name}(${2:\\\\$arg}): ${3:void}\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name}\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"\\tpublic function __construct(${2})\",\n      \"\\t{\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Foreach\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fore\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"foreach (${1:\\\\$items} as ${2:\\\\$item}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"foreach\"\n  },\n  \"Laravel route\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"route\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Route::get('${1:/path}', [${2:Controller}::class, '${3:index}']);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Laravel route\"\n  },\n  \"Laravel controller method\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ctrl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public function ${1:index}(Request \\\\$request)\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A controller method\"\n  },\n  \"Eloquent query\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"eq\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:Model}::where('${2:column}', ${3:\\\\$value})->${4:get}();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An Eloquent query\"\n  },\n  \"Try catch\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"try\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"try {\",\n      \"\\t$1\",\n      \"} catch (${2:\\\\\\\\Throwable} \\\\$e) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"try / catch\"\n  },\n  \"Var dump\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"vd\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"var_dump(${1:\\\\$value});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"var_dump\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# PHP\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for PHP.\n\n## Files\n\n`.php`, `.phtml`, `.php5`, `.inc`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 9 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `php` | Open and close tags |\n| `fn` | A function |\n| `class` | A class |\n| `fore` | foreach |\n| `route` | A Laravel route |\n| `ctrl` | A controller method |\n| `eq` | An Eloquent query |\n| `try` | try / catch |\n| `vd` | var_dump |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}